Article 3 (Approval of Settlement of Accounts) Where the Korea Trade Insurance Corporation (hereinafter referred to as the "Corporation") intends to obtain approval of its settlement of accounts under Article 55 of the Act and Article 19 of the Decree, it shall submit its financial settlement statement, accompanied by the following documents, to the Minister of Trade and Industry: <Amended on Mar. 23, 2013; Jan. 21, 2022; Oct. 1, 2025>
1. A statement of the implementation status of trade insurance business and a statement of fund management;
2. A statement of financial position and an income statement for the relevant year;
3. Other documents necessary to clarify the details of the settlement of accounts.
